le='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'></td><td style='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'></td><td style='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'>CREW REPORTED BRAKES NOT WORKING WELL.  UNUSUAL AMOUNT OF PRESSURE NEED TO SLOW ACFT ASSOCIATED WITH OTBD RT BRAKE OVERHEAT.  MX INSPECTED AND FOUND NR 3 AND NR 4 BRAKE LINES LOOSE/DISCONNECTED.  MX RESECURED THE BRAKE LINES ON THE NR 3 & NR 4 BRAKE ASSEMBLIES WITH OPS CHECKS SUCCESSFUL.  ACFT WAS APPROVED FOR RETURN TO SERVICE.</td></tr>
