style='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'></td><td style='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'></td><td style='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'>FRAME FLANGES AND WEB OF FR 94.8 STR 33-31S HAVE CORROSION.  REMOVED CORROSION FROM NR 5 SEAT TRACK IAW SRM 51-21-00-00-02, REV 12.  CONTINUED REMOVING CORROSION FROM SEAT TRACK NR 5 IAW SRM REV 12 53-20-49-02-02.  MECHANICALLY MEASURED SEAT TRACK NR 5 DEEPEST AREA FOUND 0.068".  SEAT TRACK FOUND TO BE OUT OF LIMITS IAW SRM REV 12 53-20-49-02-02. REMAINING THICKNESS FOUND TO BE 0.026" IAW SRM REV 12 53-20-49-02-02.  REMOVED DIP TRAY FOR FOM IAW SRM 51-41-00-00-01, REV 12.  REMOVED SEAT TRACK NR 5 IAW SRM 51-41-00-00-01 & 51-42-05-02-01 & 51-40-15-02-01, REV 12.  MATCH DRILLED SEAT TRACK IAW SRM 51-40-07-02-01, REV 12. OK TO INSTALL SEAT TRACK NR 5.  INSTALLED SEAT TRACK NR 5 IAW SRM 51-42-05-02-01, 51-40-15-02-01 AND 51-41-05-00-01, REV 12.  WM 20-12-10-201, REV 1.  PERFORMED GROUNDING OF METALLIC COMPONENTS, CHECK SATISFACTORY AT THIS TIME (.2 M OHMS). APPLIED TOPCOAT SURFACE PROTECTION TO RIVETS IAW SRM 51-25-15-02-01, REV 12.  INSTALLED DRIP TRAY IAW SRM 51-41-00-00-01, REV 12.</td></tr>
