yle='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'></td><td style='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'></td><td style='white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;'>ABOUT 5 MIN AFTER TAKEOFF, WE SMELLED A MELTING PLASTIC SMELL.  IT WAS MOST PREVALENT FROM THE GALLEY FWD, IT PERSISTED THE REST OF THE FLIGHT.  COMPLIED WITH ETN EM- 72-034, ENG ODOR EVENT.  NO ODORS. UPON FURTHER INVESTIGATION, FOUND HOT JUG PLUG SCORCHED & BURNED.</td></tr>
